## ai.citations contract
```python
# A citation is valid only when ALL three conditions hold:
# 1. chunk_id is in the retrieved set for this request
# 2. The cited section/locator string appears in the chunk text
# 3. A relevance check finds overlapping legal terms
```

## HTMX views
- Return `HttpResponse` with an HTML partial, never full page on HTMX requests
- Check `request.htmx` (from `django-htmx`) before returning partials
- All `POST` views require CSRF; do not exempt chat or wizard endpoints

## AnswerAudit model
```python
# Never store question text.  Store only:
# query_hmac  = HMAC-SHA256(question, key=settings.AUDIT_HMAC_KEY)
# query_hmac_key_id  = identifier for key rotation
```

## Security checklist (run before any PR)
- [ ] No secret in source; all in `.env`
- [ ] `DEBUG=False` in non-runserver path
- [ ] `ALLOWED_HOSTS` set
- [ ] CSP header active (`django-csp`)
- [ ] CSRF not exempted on chat/wizard
- [ ] Ollama bound to 127.0.0.1 (check `check_system.ps1`)
- [ ] Rate limit active on `/assistant/ask/`
